      "text": "# TRU PLACE\n\nType a packed city. Get the coordinate. Not a map.\n\nThe list is Natural Earth populated places, 1:10m, public domain. Major cities and significant towns. A name not in the list is not packed. No roads. No live pin.\n\nSave `index.html`. Open it in a browser. If it needs a network to run, it is not a lane.\n"
